NoFace: {
	DisplayName: The Faceless Woman
	Origin: On a rain-soaked bridge, she borrowed your face
	Power: 「Borrowed Face」Steals a target's visage and briefly copies their abilities
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
}

LanternBoy: {
	DisplayName: The Lantern Boy
	Origin: A lamp at the end of the mountain road, no one beneath it; look again, and you are the one inside the lamp
	Power: 「Guiding Light」Shadows cast by the lantern mirror the bearer's actions, wielding six-tenths of their strength
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
}

CrimsonBride: {
	DisplayName: The Crimson Bride
	Origin: The bridal palanquin waited at the gate for seven nights
	Power: 「The Procession」The final piece of the set; allows Ghost Lanterns to be stacked upon yourself
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
}

ScapeGhost: {
	DisplayName: The Scapegoat Wraith
	Origin: It had no name in life, only the memory of dying in another's place again and again. When the register turns, its birth date is written beside yours
	Power: 「Death's Stand-In」At the instant death arrives, it seizes a life from afar and forces your death into that body
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
}

HeadlessShade: {
	DisplayName: The Headless Shade
	Origin: The shadow at your feet twitches; on nights when the lamplight sways, there is nothing above its shoulders
	Power: 「Dismember」It lurks behind you, then rushes anything living and tears its body into pieces
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
}

GhostHand: {
	DisplayName: The Charred Hand
	Origin: A charred, withered, horrifying arm
	Power: 「Grip」Seized targets are suppressed and their movement is restricted
	DeathReason: "{0} was dragged into the wall"
}

WellThing: {
	DisplayName: The Ringing in the Well
	Origin: ———
	Power: ———
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
}

DebugWraith: {
	DisplayName: Debug Wraith
	Origin: A colorless specimen. It exists only to prove the machinery of haunting still turns
	Power: 「Placeholder」— it drifts, it stares back, and it scatters at a touch
	DeathReason: "{0} touched what must never be touched"
	OmenDeath: "{0} failed to break the specimen's gaze within three breaths"
}

System: {
	HaltPopup: HALTED
	RiteFirstBind: 「{0}」has been set upon the register
	RiteRenewPact: 「{0}」has renewed the pact — it knows this hand now
	RiteResubdue: 「{0}」has been pressed back onto the register
	RiteDeniedSealed: The seal holds; the name may not be shown
	RiteDeniedEscaped: It does not know this hand — find the one who let it loose
	VesselRequired: No vessel capable of bearing a wraith is at hand
