	ScapeGhostNoTarget: No living thing answers; the mark dies with you
	ScapeGhostUnknownTarget: something living
	ScapeGhostDeathBroadcast: "{0} took the hit for {1} — {2}"
	BacklashEscape: 「{0}」has torn itself off the register
	BacklashFade: 「{0}」's presence has scattered — it will return
